    "title": "HTTP/S DeliveryPolicy retry values: minDelayTarget >= 1, maxDelayTarget <= 3600 and >= minDelayTarget, numRetries 0..100 and at least the sum of the phase retries, phase counts >= 0, backoffFunction one of arithmetic|exponential|geometric|linear, maxReceivesPerSecond >= 1 (subscription DeliveryPolicy and topic DeliveryPolicy.http)",
